DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260525T200000
UID:69e8fa84b1165a41a660ed04@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have questions about your tablet\, phone\, laptop\, email or a
 n app? Need help with eBooks or other online library services?\nWe know ke
 eping up with new technology can be difficult. Our staff are here to teach
  you technology tools and concepts in a friendly and casual setting. Pleas
 e bring your personal device and any questions you may have.\nDrop-in help
  available on a first come\, first serve basis. Space may be limited depe
 nding on attendance.\nLonger questions may be referred to a 1-hour Book a 
 Librarian appointment at a later date.\nNo technology repairs will be avai
 lable at this event.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e8fa84b1165a41a660ed04
