 une\nby Anne Tyler.\nThis title is available from the Toronto Public Libra
 ry in multiple formats including large print\, audiobook\, and through TPL
 's OverDrive eBooks & eAudiobooks collection.\nBrentwood Book Club will be
  taking a break from meetings in July and August\, and will resume in Sept
