 r projects\, swap tips\, learn new techniques (or even teach a few) all wh
 ile enjoying great conversation. We encourage you to bring your own suppli
 es\, however some yarn\, knitting needles\, and crochet hooks will be avai
 lable for you to use.\nDrop-in\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Kennedy/Eglinton\, Large Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/696506621e64afd01e53da19
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
